Here `OLD(Count)` refers to the value of `Count` at the beginning of the function. The comment "@@@ Value of Count decreases by 1 in the function" indicates that after a removal operation, the count of items in the list is expected to decrease by 1. The corresponding assert statement checks if this is the case after the function has been executed.
